    "remediation": "Enable masking in Settings \u003e CI/CD \u003e Variables. GitLab requires a value of at least 8 characters; restructure the secret if it cannot be masked by length.",
    "docUrl": "https://getplumber.io/docs/cli/issues/ISSUE-202",
    "controlName": "cicdVariablesMustBeMasked",
